\subsection{RL Robustness}
\label{sec:exp-rl}

Table~\ref{tab:rl-robust} reports DIF robustness across training paradigms. Adding alignment-RL models (DPO/ORPO, $N=477$) preserves 88\% of DIF flags with Jaccard similarity 0.76 to the SFT-only baseline. Adding all RL models (including 13 reasoning-RL) maintains 82\% retention with Jaccard 0.71.

