\subsection{ConStat Independent Evaluation}
\label{sec:exp-constat}

We independently evaluate ConStat on 220 reformulated items. Table~\ref{tab:constat-type} reports performance stratified by model type. ConStat achieves AUROC 0.67 on non-RL models but degrades to 0.52 (near-random) on reasoning-RL models, confirming its known vulnerability to RL-induced smoothing.

